{"name": "Alien Apocalypse", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"78\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/10061f68de9160ca7473b0aaa8a356d0.avif?t=1787335104\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An survival sandbox built around one idea: to simulate what it means to survive in a world taken over by aliens.   <br/>No one knows exactly how it started, only that the world has changed beyond recognition. <br/>Civilization has collapsed, and humanity is no longer in control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now the few survivors struggle to endure, not just against hunger, cold, and fear, but against something far more powerful that now rules the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alien Apocalypse is an open-world sandbox survival game set in the aftermath of this unexpected event.<br/>Adapt, build, explore, and turn alien technology into your last hope for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/abf4532187f87961c228f3785d8ff5ad.poster.avif?t=1787335104\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/abf4532187f87961c228f3785d8ff5ad.webm?t=1787335104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/abf4532187f87961c228f3785d8ff5ad.mp4?t=1787335104\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"78\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/d1b97ddb04691c8ff49e0d39c3e7886f.avif?t=1787335104\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world has become unpredictable, harsh, and hostile.<br/>You\u2019ll need to scavenge for food, craft tools, and fortify shelters to withstand constant threats.<br/>Hunger, thirst, and exhaustion are as deadly as any creature you\u2019ll face.<br/>There are no heroes here, only survivors trying to make it one more day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/0f1ddfba5544e03b90450dc74d060ad3.poster.avif?t=1787335104\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/0f1ddfba5544e03b90450dc74d060ad3.webm?t=1787335104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/0f1ddfba5544e03b90450dc74d060ad3.mp4?t=1787335104\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"78\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/ac49eca329d618c1cd3f2a0e3dcd5ac4.avif?t=1787335104\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The planet is overrun by lifeforms and technology no one fully understands.<br/>Collect alien technology, study it, and learn to reverse-engineer it.<br/>Turn the invaders\u2019 own weapons against them, or build hybrid tools that fuse human and alien engineering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/b69ae0b10d58abe43f911effc5401a3e.poster.avif?t=1787335104\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/b69ae0b10d58abe43f911effc5401a3e.webm?t=1787335104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/b69ae0b10d58abe43f911effc5401a3e.mp4?t=1787335104\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"78\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/d3e725a1fabb0f54ae17659f5dd7ba9d.avif?t=1787335104\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you face the apocalypse alone or with friends, survival demands preparation.<br/>Play solo for a tense, personal challenge, or team up in online co-op to share supplies, build together, and defend your base from alien incursions.<br/>Every alliance comes with risk, and trust can be as fragile as the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/bcd9055087e0a708754771339a64679f.poster.avif?t=1787335104\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/bcd9055087e0a708754771339a64679f.webm?t=1787335104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/bcd9055087e0a708754771339a64679f.mp4?t=1787335104\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"78\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/370d0b14f83911c477ced8bc4e2d8c96.avif?t=1787335104\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of Alien Apocalypse was built to be explored.<br/>From crumbling city blocks to desolate countryside, danger and opportunity are everywhere.<br/>Climb, jump, and move with freedom to  escape danger and discover hidden paths.<br/>Every building could be a shelter\u2026 or a trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/4d390cf7ee7fd5bebe543596561391aa.poster.avif?t=1787335104\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/4d390cf7ee7fd5bebe543596561391aa.webm?t=1787335104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/4d390cf7ee7fd5bebe543596561391aa.mp4?t=1787335104\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"78\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/476894145f9f4acc9e23a0f490c1158e.avif?t=1787335104\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The creatures that now roam the planet are not mindless beasts.<br/>They think, learn, and change.<br/>Each encounter is different, and the deeper you explore, the more unpredictable they become.<br/>The longer you survive, the more the world itself seems to turn against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/a0af910c67d04aa6ae8be7cedc9a6085.poster.avif?t=1787335104\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/a0af910c67d04aa6ae8be7cedc9a6085.webm?t=1787335104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/a0af910c67d04aa6ae8be7cedc9a6085.mp4?t=1787335104\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"78\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/b6ad8420d7fd5eb8d97a93248ca79252.avif?t=1787335104\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn\u2019t a game about saving the world.<br/>It\u2019s about discovering what\u2019s left of it and surviving one more day.<br/>Create your survivor, shape your path, and make your own story in a world that no longer belongs to us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/3cc3a25b9868f7ff6c627b6890275cec.poster.avif?t=1787335104\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/3cc3a25b9868f7ff6c627b6890275cec.webm?t=1787335104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/extras/3cc3a25b9868f7ff6c627b6890275cec.mp4?t=1787335104\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "An open-world sandbox survival game set after a devastating alien invasion. Scavenge for resources, craft, build defenses, and harness alien technology to fight back. Play solo or in co-op and reclaim what\u2019s left of the planet.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635510/6b217165fa21d163a0d8e7597de6e8e9dd43b52d/header.jpg?t=1787335104", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Survival", "Open World", "Aliens", "Open World Survival Craft", "Simulation"], "developers": "Umbu Games", "publishers": "Umbu Games", "release_date": "Aug 21, 2026", "price": "$16.19", "appid": "3635510", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "9 December 2025 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Y1nf0N8rXCA", "first_seen": 1765234800.0, "review_rank": 1396}